# Claude Code
# .claude/settings.local.json holds machine-local permissions and stays out.
# Skills are repo knowledge and must be committed — git will not descend into
# an excluded directory, so this has to exclude the CONTENTS, not the dir.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

